  hpx.native.integrations.federation -[planned_flow]-> hpx.native.authority "Recheck disclosure / execution policy" { metadata { evidence "docs/06-subsystems/security-cryptography.md" scope "logical responsibility; no code refactor" }
    link ../../06-subsystems/security-cryptography.md
